      "text": "THE NON-LINEAR WRITING APP Prose for Pros. Every great sentence takes flight more than one way. Download Now Scroll for more information ↓ The evening had been threatening for hours. The rain found her before the door did. She did not reach for the umbrella. REVISION Original Take 2 Take 3 + New version Fork any sentence. Because you have more than just one idea in your head Keep every version. Write a sentence three different ways, and pick the one that lands. Branch inside a branch. Let the rabbit hole go deep. The evening had been threatening for hours. She stepped out into the waiting rain",
